  "description": "Test build of Quinn as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Quinn so Behind Enemy Lines mounts her on Valor for a few seconds at full speed and her next attack, Q or E - or the ride running out - lands with Skystrike (the main pack: one ride straight at the target), and on screen she rides Valor while it lasts. A hook presses it as League players do: out of the base to her lane after a respawn or a recall, to an ally fighting or chased far away, after a low enemy out of reach, and on long walks. Vault flips her back the way she dashed in (about an attack range) after the kick. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-26",
  "mod_id": "league_quinn",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Quinn's ride on Valor (test)",
  "version": "0.7.5"
}
